#
# The registries ncmake pulls a container image from, tried in the order given until
# one serves it. Each line holds a prefix of the image reference ncmake asks for,
# followed by the prefixes that replace it, one per source. The longest prefix that
# matches applies. An image no line matches is pulled from its own reference, and that
# reference is tried last on any line that does not list it. Every source of a line
# must serve the same images as the reference, digest for digest.

# The Docker Official Images. Docker Hub limits anonymous pulls the most, so it comes
# last.
docker.io/library/      public.ecr.aws/docker/library/  mirror.gcr.io/library/  docker.io/library/

# ECR Public carries only the Docker Official Images; mirror.gcr.io caches others too.
docker.io/fsfe/reuse    mirror.gcr.io/fsfe/reuse        docker.io/fsfe/reuse
